00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:59.560
discovery of new problem, and then it's

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:01.480
feedbacks entirely into my new content

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:03.320
again. I create YouTube videos that

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:05.520
solve long-tail customer problem. My

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:07.440
