00:06:50.919 --> 00:06:54.520
>> So, this is my three-step process for my

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:56.280
content flywheel. Step one, collect

00:06:54.520 --> 00:06:58.640
customer pain. I do not brainstorm

00:06:56.280 --> 00:07:00.600
content ideas. I harvest customer pain.

00:06:58.640 --> 00:07:02.320
And I have four touch points to harvest

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:04.200
the customer pain. The first touch point

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:06.120
is I go into communities where my

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:08.040
customers hang out. I silently go there

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:10.040
and I read through those conversation. I

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:12.040
make a list and see if there's a pain

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:13.880
that is being repeated day after day. If

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:16.040
I feel, I start a conversation there to

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:17.480
get more context to the problem. I never

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:19.160
sell on the communities. Touch point

00:07:17.480 --> 00:07:20.680
number two is onboarding emails. So,

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:22.520
once a customer signs up on our

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:24.520
services, I send out an email to my

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:26.720
customer, "Do you want any custom

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:28.640
tutorial just meant for you?" And we

00:07:26.720 --> 00:07:30.280
have a lot of good tutorial ideas

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:32.520
submitted by the customers. And it

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:34.200
exactly speaks a long tail problem the

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:36.240
customer is facing, and what is their

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:38.160
confusion. Then touch point three is our

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:40.320
customer support. If you go into our

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:42.320
website and look at our reviews, we have

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:44.080
more than 100 five-star reviews, and

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:45.800
most of the reviews talk about customer

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:47.720
support. That is because we treat

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:49.680
